  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Upscaling the development of national/institutional media and information  literacy (MIL) policies and digital competencies</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development of media and information literacy (MIL) policies and capacities is a priority for South Asia, given the wide spread propagation of  misinformation and disinformation, especially during elections. Member States and institutions require urgent interventions to counter hate speech that threaten social cohesion and unity. The menace of hate speech is also acutely felt by media institutions because it  contributes to drivers of crimes against journalists.</narrative>
  </description>
